  partName: Bolt
  description: The Bolt is a tiny, thin-flat component located at the middle-center-front
    of the engine, playing a crucial role in securing various engine parts together.
    Made of material 0, it ensures the stability and integrity of the engine's structure.
    Interestingly, its small size belies its importance, as a loose or missing bolt
    can lead to significant engine damage.
